Melty is for mods and mashups of existing games only. Confirm the project actually changes, connects or plays from a required host game. A program of its own counts when it plays from the player's copy of a game (a rewrite or port: the player must have that game, and Melty passes its folder at launch so the program never asks for it). Standalone games that need no existing game, browser games, mockups and unrelated demos do not qualify. If that is what you find, explain it and ask whether I want help turning it into a real game mod; do not upload or publish it, add a game tag as a workaround, or pretend a browser preview is gameplay in the host game. A game-inspired project is not automatically a game mod.

